{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y90nupkv","slide":1,"text":"Source: user-provided Desktop/BRIGHT_model_editable_v1.pptx. Retains user image edits and model topology. Inputs: Chen et al., BRIGHT (ESSD 2025), doi:10.5194/essd-17-6217-2025, Figure 6 Turkey event; imagery credits Table 2. The output image is retained from the supplied deck and is labelled Example map because its provenance as a model prediction has not been established. Blue denotes current-region representations, orange historical support, and gray base-network components. V_j: local-token set of support building j. U_j: current-query-aligned readout from that support. Q: soft pixel-to-region assignment. Icon colours do not represent measured feature values."}